  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bbc3b75e-0291-4e09-89f7-2740faebc58e",
    "name": "Enveda Content API (WordPress REST wp/v2) Search API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Enveda publishes enveda.com on WordPress, which exposes the WordPress REST API at https://enveda.com/wp-json/. The wp/v2 namespace is anonymously readable and returns the company's news releases, In-Veda blog posts, marketing pages, leadership and team profiles (`person`), clinical-trial site listings (`wpsl_stores`), the media library, taxonomies and a site-wide search endpoint as JSON.\n\nThis document was DERIVED mechanically by API Evangelist from the route-discovery document served at https://enveda.com/wp-json/ on 2026-08-04 — every path, method and parameter below is taken verbatim from that descriptor. Enveda does not publish an OpenAPI definition of its own, and this is not a product API: it is the content API the CMS exposes. Write operations exist on these routes but require authentication (WordPress Application Passwords over HTTP Basic).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Enveda",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
